wh40k-footfall-quest-watch-title = Clear the approach
wh40k-footfall-quest-watch-desc = Footfall needs its expedition approaches kept clear. Defeat two hormagaunts; return to Maris for confirmation.
wh40k-footfall-quest-watch-objective = Defeat two hormagaunts with credited participation.
wh40k-footfall-quest-contacts-title = Keep the port connected
wh40k-footfall-quest-contacts-desc = Finish a conversation with Hest Varn and Sera Holt, then report to Maris.
wh40k-footfall-quest-contacts-objective = Finish a conversation with Hest Varn.
wh40k-footfall-quest-cargo-title = Food for the next shift
wh40k-footfall-quest-cargo-desc = Hest needs two sealed cans of grox porridge. Carry them in your hands or equipment and hand them over at his desk.
wh40k-footfall-quest-cargo-objective = Hand over exactly two cans of grox porridge.
wh40k-footfall-quest-grid-title = Check the dock grid
wh40k-footfall-quest-grid-desc = Aveline needs a reliable arrival report from the Footfall docks. Reach the designated platform and return with your report.
wh40k-footfall-quest-grid-objective = Reach the marked Footfall dock grid.
wh40k-footfall-quest-system-title = Aivorius route check
wh40k-footfall-quest-system-desc = Enter the Aivorius system and return to Aveline with a route report.
wh40k-footfall-quest-system-objective = Reach the Aivorius system.
wh40k-footfall-quest-sector-title = First steps into Koronus
wh40k-footfall-quest-sector-desc = Reach the Koronus Expanse and confirm your arrival with Aveline.
wh40k-footfall-quest-sector-objective = Reach the Koronus Expanse sector.
wh40k-footfall-quest-diagnostics-title = Read the diagnostic station
wh40k-footfall-quest-diagnostics-desc = Read the diagnostic console and report its readings to Khepra. Leave the station settings alone.
wh40k-footfall-quest-diagnostics-objective = Interact with the Footfall diagnostic console.
wh40k-footfall-quest-nutrition-title = Triage nutrition check
wh40k-footfall-quest-nutrition-desc = Show Sera three Imperial nutrient bars in hands or equipment. This inspection does not consume them; they must still be present when reporting.
wh40k-footfall-quest-nutrition-objective = Have three Imperial nutrient bars at confirmation.
wh40k-footfall-quest-contacts-sera = Finish a conversation with Sera Holt.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-intro = Maris closes a crowded ledger. "If this can wait, it will. If someone cannot, tell me now."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-service = "I have work that keeps this port breathing. Choose what you can finish."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-tell = "I used to count ships. Now I count how many families still have someone coming home."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-pressure = "The record does not confirm it yet. Bring me facts; I will make time for them."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-accepted = "Recorded. Be precise, and come back in one piece. That last part is a request."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-payoff = "Confirmed. A small task, perhaps, but one less crack in the port. Thank you."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-marisveyra-farewell = "Safe travels. Footfall needs people who return."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-intro = Hest Varn, quartermaster. Collect cargo at this window; ask me for work. If you're here to argue about a delay, give me the manifest number first. Every delay has its own biography.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-service = I can offer work, check a delivery, or help you choose warehouse supplies. What do you need? A proper label saves more nerves than a shouted order.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-tell = I remember crews that came back one person short. That's why I check supplies twice and dislike heroics on an empty stomach. The paperwork, at least, always returns in full.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-pressure = The required count or confirmation isn't there yet. Check the commission and bring the cargo here; we'll sort it out without shouting. Shouting doesn't enlarge the warehouse.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-accepted = Agreed: two sealed tins. The loaders will be grateful, even if they only express it by making the food disappear.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-payoff = The count matches; cargo accepted. One shift fed, one manifest closed. Now we can discuss the next job.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-hestvarn-farewell = Watch the gangway. Eat before a sortie: it's easier for you to carry a ration inside you than for rescuers to carry you.
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-intro = Aveline listens a moment before looking up. "The void is loud today. Speak; your voice is nearer."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-service = "A route becomes useful when someone returns to describe it. Shall we begin nearby?"
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-tell = "Some paths remind me of people I lost. I still chart them. Forgetting would be another loss."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-pressure = "The route has not answered yet. Check the destination, not merely the name on a screen."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-accepted = "Take the route carefully. I prefer an untidy report from a living traveller."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-payoff = "A confirmed arrival. That is a sound I can trust. You have my thanks."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-avelinequill-farewell = "Return when you can. I will leave a place for your report."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-intro = Khepra tilts a brass lens. "Your arrival is unplanned. Its usefulness remains to be determined."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-service = "Inspection tasks are available. Observe first. Unauthorised adjustment is not inspection."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-tell = "This relay predates three of my mentors. I maintain it because none of them could teach it to me twice."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-pressure = "Confirmation absent. Preserve the apparatus; repeat the authorised observation."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-accepted = "Task registered. Your hands may serve knowledge if they remain patient."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-payoff = "Observation verified. Reliable work is rare. I have recorded your name beside it."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-omicronkhepra-farewell = "Go with care. I would prefer not to catalogue your equipment as salvage."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-intro = Sera looks up from a stained chart. "Bleeding, breathing badly, or here to help? Start with that."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-service = "Supplies and careful hands. I can use both. Choose a task you can actually finish."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-tell = "I joke when the ward is quiet. When it is not, I remember the names. Neither habit is easy."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-pressure = "I cannot sign that off yet. Keep the supplies with you and let me check properly."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-accepted = "Good. Keep the bars available; exhausted people make mistakes before they admit they are hungry."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-payoff = "That checks out. Thank you for doing a small thing before it became an emergency."
wh40k-footfall-dialogue-seraholt-farewell = "Drink water. Come back alive. Yes, those are medical instructions."
